Sliding window with last-seen index. O(n) time.

For longest substring basic I will maintain a window of unique chars and shrink from the left on duplicate.

```python
def longest(s):
    seen = {}
    lo, out = 0, 0
    for hi, c in enumerate(s):
        if c in seen and seen[c] >= lo:
            lo = seen[c] + 1
        seen[c] = hi
        out = max(out, hi - lo + 1)
    return out
```

